  "description": "Experience the freedom a Brompton folding bike brings you, as you move in and around the city. And if you need to get away, just pop your Brompton on a plane, train, or in the car and create your adventure. Thanks to its compact size, the Brompton fold-up is welcomed at most places and venues.\n\nKeep things simple with our classic black finish, it never goes out of fashion. The Brompton H6L in Black features an H-type handlebar supporting a more upright riding style, great if you enjoy riding while enjoying scenic views. It boasts a full range of 6 gears covering all riding needs, great for hilly areas, while the included mudguards are a perfect option if you live in a region that rains.",
